Package: SurveyNCD
Title: Survey-Weighted Analysis of Self-Reported Health Indicators
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Sujon", "Mia", email = "sujonsgc@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-1032-2818")),
      person("Md. Atiqul", "Islam", email = "atique@stat.jnu.ac.bd",
